    "发之前还能逐项关掉。路线的起点和终点各 200 米不显示。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can turn any of these off before you post. The first and last 200 m of a route are hidden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "發之前還能逐項關掉。路線的起點和終點各 200 公尺不顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
