    "没看到运动记录？前往 设置 › App › 健康 › 数据访问与设备 › 外卡，打开读取。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Don't see your workouts? Go to Settings › Apps › Health › Data Access & Devices › Wildcard and turn on reading."
